User-02 As a user, I want the system to automatically send my order and direct the robot to the appropriate bins, so that my selected items are retrieved without manual input.

Acceptance Criteria:
-The system automatically tracks the robot starting a pending order, updating the visible order status to IN_PROGRESS.
-The mobile robot autonomously drives to and identifies the exact bin locations based on the customer's selected ball colors.
-The robot navigates between multiple color stations in the order until all requested item locations have been visited.
-If a path is blocked, the system flags the order with an error status and alerts operations instead of stalling indefinitely.